I like this idea.  The reason being is that every game there would be a
brand-new artifact. Every game you'd have to figure out exactly what it
was and what it's powers were.

Does it drain levels? Does it convey magic resistance?  What happens if
I invoke it?

Whereas now the user knows instantly from the spoiler tables what
Giantslayer or Grayswandir or Stormbringer do, this new artifact would
have completely random behavior from game to game. As a result, it is a
mystery.   I think it would be fun to have to experiment with it to
find out what the extent of it's powers would be.

